TIGLT-PRIO-DEC       REC    +85   2  N                                          
SEMI14               REC    +87   1  A                                          
TIGLT-PRIO-DAG-NUM   REC    +88   3  N                                          
FILL5                REC    +91   1  A    VALUE ','                             
TIGLT-PRIO-DAG-DEC   REC    +92   2  N                                          
SEMI15               REC    +94   1  A                                          
TIGLT-PRIO-KVALL-NUM REC    +95   3  N                                          
